  "description": "Upgrade your vehicle's visibility and safety with these manual extendable tow mirrors. Featuring a built-in manual convex blind spot mirror and power-heated functionality, these mirrors ensure a clear view in any weather. The smoked lens LED turn signals and integrated clearance lamp enhance visibility for other drivers. Designed with durable plastic housing and a textured black finish, these mirrors are both stylish and rugged. Reinforcement brackets minimize vibrations for a stable view, while the easy installation process saves you time. Backed by a limited 1-year warranty for added peace of mind. Perfect for towing and everyday use.\nFitment\n2007 Chevy Silverado Pickup new body style models\n2007 GMC Sierra Pickup new body style models\n2007-2013 Chevy Tahoe / Suburban / Avalanche\n2007-2013 GMC Yukon XL Denali\n2008-2013 Chevy Silverado All Models\n2008-2013 GMC Sierra All Models\n2014 Chevy Silverado 2500HD 3500HD\n2014 GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nHigh-quality Material\nThese towing mirrors are made by ultra-strong and lightweight black durable textured ABS plastic, with black shell, aluminum material base for more stable construction.\nLED Turn Signal\nWith LED turn signal, these mirrors can ensure a safer driving experience and give your vehicle a cooler look. A clearance lamp can be connected to the corner light(wire included).\nMirror Adjustment\nThe upper mirrors are power-adjusted, so you can easily adjust the mirror without reaching your hand out of the window. While the lower mirror is manaul adjusted, and it works as a blind spot mirror to expand your vision.\nExtendable Towing Mirrors\nWith extendable towing mirrors, you can adjust the length of the mirror. They are manually extendable. Extend them when you're towing. When you're not towing, you can shorten them to standard length.\nEasy Installation.\nThese tow mirrors are plug-and-play. They come with installation instructions, including wiring diagrams to help you.",
